# Cross-origin isolation so SharedArrayBuffer is available and ONNX Runtime Web can
# run multi-threaded WASM in production. COEP uses `credentialless` instead of
# `require-corp` so that cross-origin resources without a CORP header (the
# analytics tracker and the external site favicons) are not blocked.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
